# Cloudflare Pages static redirects (Next's `output: export` cannot express a
# server-side redirect, and a client-side bounce would be a soft 404 for a crawler).
#
# /resume is the URL shape recruiters and the competing namesake's page use. The
# document lives at /cv, which keeps its canonical, so this is a permanent alias and
# not a second page: no sitemap entry, no duplicate metadata. The trailing-slash form
# is listed separately because Cloudflare matches the path literally.
/resume /cv 301
/resume/ /cv 301
